2. Per-catalog licenses
======================

License summaries are a guide to the full terms, not additional restrictions or
substitute licenses. Retain the applicable license texts and notices when
redistributing material. For CC BY content, retain attribution and identify
modifications. For CC BY-SA content, also license shared adaptations under the
applicable ShareAlike terms. Follow the full license for the material you reuse.
Source-specific notices and separately identified third-party material remain
subject to their own applicable terms. This file grants no trademark rights or
endorsement by the original publishers.

Each .gezk contains LICENSES/ with full license texts and catalog notices, plus
source provenance where applicable. Hugging Face release directories also carry
license sidecars. The source records linked below provide the current catalog
definitions; the records bundled with an immutable release describe that release.

